      "schemeImageUrl": "",
      "detailedDescription_md": "The &amp;quot;Fellowship Scholarship Scheme&amp;quot; by the Education Department, Government of Gujarat, aims to provide financial assistance to meritorious students who secure 70% or more marks in Class 10th and are pursuing higher secondary or higher education. The primary objective is to encourage education among the Scheduled Caste (SC), Scheduled Tribe (ST), Physically Backward Classes, and other eligible categories by providing monetary support based on their merit in Class 11th and subsequent studies.\n<br>\n\n",
      "benefits_md": "\n  - **Annual Scholarship:** Financial assistance is provided every year to eligible students.\n<br>\n\n",
      "briefDescription": "The \"Fellowship Scholarship Scheme\" by the Education Department, Government of Gujarat, aims to provide financial help to students by granting an annual monetary award to those who secure 70% or more marks in Class 10th and pursue higher education.",
      "exclusions_md": "<br>\n\n",
